Begin3
Title:                  LFNDOS
Description:            Provides  long filename support
Keywords:               long file name, lfn
Summary:                Provides the Windows 95 long filename API to DOS programs. Any DOS program which can use long filenames, for example DOS 7 Command.com, edit.com and all DJGPP programs, can load and save using them with LFNDOS. Designed for Win95 users using DOS-mode, although it works under old DOS versions too.
End
